@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam backgroundColor white

title CQRS崩壊：AIが自律的に決定・実行する状態\n[CQRS Collapse: State Where AI Autonomously Decides and Executes]

actor "人間\n(管理職)\n(Human Manager)" as Human

package "AI (境界なし)\n(AI [No Boundary])" <<Collapsed>> #FFE0E0 {
    component "AIエージェント\n(Query + Command 混在)\n(AI Agent)\n[Mixed Query + Command]" as AI
    note left of AI
        **【設計ミス】**
        Queryのはずが
        Commandも実行している。
        
        責任の所在：消滅。
        不可逆な結果：誰のもの？
        ---
        **[Design Error]**
        Supposed to be Query, but
        executing Command as well.
        
        Accountability: Vanished.
        Irreversible outcomes: Whose responsibility?
    end note
}

database "組織の状態\n(データ/現実)\n(Organizational State)\n[Data / Reality]" as DB

' --- AI自律ループ ---
AI -down-> DB : "③ 自ら判断し、状態を書き換える\n(不可逆な実行)\n(3. Autonomously judges & rewrites state)\n[Irreversible execution]"
DB -up-> AI : "① 現在の状態を読み取る\n(1. Reads current state)"
AI -> AI : "② 自律的に決断する\n(人間の承認なし)\n(2. Autonomously decides)\n[Without human approval]"

' --- 人間は蚊帳の外 ---
Human .up.> AI : "④ 事後に通知を受ける\n（決定権なし）\n(4. Receives post-hoc notification)\n[No decision-making power]"

note bottom of DB
    **このとき何が失われるか**
    ──────────────────
    【CQRS崩壊】 QueryとCommandの境界が消える
    【IoC崩壊】  人間がCallしていない。AIが勝手に動く
    【DIP崩壊】  AIの判断基準がAI自身の中に閉じている
    【SRP崩壊】  「推論」と「決断」が同一モジュールに混在
    ---
    **What is Lost in This State**
    ──────────────────
    [CQRS Collapse] Boundary between Query and Command disappears
    [IoC Collapse]  Humans are not calling it; AI operates on its own
    [DIP Collapse]  AI's decision criteria are encapsulated within itself
    [SRP Collapse]  "Inference" and "Decision" mixed in the same module
end note

@endluml